{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 33","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/3/a73290091dc1ccc2abcfca4d431d0b4562f81c17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2x}-3^{2y}=55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"114\" height=\"18\" />, in which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> are integers, is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/b/a6bc1b96cd570e295625859fd6c23a66e6ab7b6b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{(A)} \\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)} \\ 1 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)} \\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)} \\ 3\\qquad \\textbf{(E)} \\ \\text{More than three, but finite}\\]\" width=\"533\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/6/8665647b23fab9e336680170ee5f300b4e8f4e7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2^x$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8e4d107f80db7d844e089db26769a9e626f03b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3^y$\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />.  Substituting these values results in\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/2435d232019168f1aec7aad9c2b56ce16372f5b8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 - b^2 = 55\\]\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\nFactor the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a> to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/def4058df3ce9a984bab0e4649e65633bbd73931.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a + b)(a - b) = 55\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/8/d98424e07dba484162112ed0575862bd8fcf880b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56b4b339e39284523deed660c14118f2aad63950.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55 + 3^{2y} &lt; 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> can not be negative.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a68e8aa6ec6f48231ad80a4851f84bacf641b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/2/d1223fb08fd5e9867401663ac90387c30fe5f465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2x} &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/3732bec04566e8ea802e8416d72ceda5633d49b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{2y}$\" width=\"22\" height=\"15\" /> is always positive, the result would be way less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> can not be negative.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> have to be <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Nonnegative\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nonnegative\">nonnegative</a>, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Integers\">integers</a>.  Thus,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/c/0fc81447e1ef64e9fc387f003f3bb5a4a9bc03ea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+b=55 \\text{ and } a-b=1\\]\" width=\"191\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/7/ed748d15ea9de34b1afaf8ddf810cbedece4f122.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{or}\\]\" width=\"15\" height=\"8\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0f1551ef82af54a0c8da1c18c66a211dad4c512.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a+b=11 \\text{ and } a-b=5\\]\" width=\"192\" height=\"14\" />\nFrom the first case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/1/461460b266515cdc0e7f3835ff89f217ae67e01b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 28$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/c/98ce0a0b28eb617424f0a182e0de046fab274a93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 27$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f69a3f36ee5416a527f052ba60afedb6d6257598.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^x = 28$\" width=\"59\" height=\"12\" /> does not have an integral solution, the first case does not work.\nFrom the second case, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/9/51955db01f1d3ae46f724e189a1438a0d775657e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 8$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/246ec286b9641f91f9dfa14932e47171e2fad854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />.  Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />.  Thus, there is only one solution, which is answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>By Ajeet Dubey | <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ioqm.in\">ioqm.in</a></i>\n</p><p><b>Step 1: Eliminate negative exponents</b>\n</p><p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6ee81a7a535d87853e848c77654cc36104a75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />. Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a943870c04c3bf8169ed8c41332cb6766bbb6ec8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[0&lt;2^{2x}&lt;1 \\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad 3^{2y}&gt;0.\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"16\" />\nTherefore\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/e/b4e68ec90599d45bf9674f2c3afc46620a356182.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^{2x}-3^{2y}&lt;1,\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"19\" />\nwhich cannot equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b79030abeb688469b5ffc2e1c4e37fee225a529e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Hence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/8/ed846ce2d35162698b1eab724ba240718789fd93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/8/ed846ce2d35162698b1eab724ba240718789fd93.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" />, the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/d/23d30c8fca075e2c5de27f27592941ca57dad165.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"26\" height=\"17\" /> is an integer. Thus\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/f/9bf99f45665260892cd7b999a3916a6330944a7a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3^{2y}=2^{2x}-55\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\nmust also be an integer. However, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14fdb7fc1a58d1fa221727ace4b9cd7ddc35eeb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />, then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daaec250ad01fc26a3e76f0e1197a91e6f7733ed.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3^{2y}=\\frac{1}{3^{-2y}}\\]\" width=\"84\" height=\"37\" />\nis a proper fraction. This is impossible, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a34a53a91f16c862705e5e466f965f7cf5a6ff71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y\\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><b>Step 2: Factor the equation</b>\n</p><p>Set\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/c/8dc1a43d2920a96543a0ba1504af50628f1614e6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a=2^x \\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad b=3^y.\\]\" width=\"196\" height=\"13\" />\nNow <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> are positive integers, and\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/66336d0ed5a5cedf89473b9c06bc9be708f99a60.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2-b^2=55.\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"15\" />\nFactoring gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/4/044283fc901f099631dc50ec6cb6c4aebdf02cf2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a-b)(a+b)=55.\\]\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><b>Step 3: Check the factor pairs</b>\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/a/faaa8e0ee4c7cc10efb7957393ffcba8ba661bca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a&gt;b&gt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />, both factors are positive. The only possibilities are\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/4/d340941eaf6f64087074f73dbb1243d0c0a02a86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a-b,a+b)=(1,55) \\qquad\\text{or}\\qquad (5,11).\\]\" width=\"307\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/6/716278f1679b50e5bb4450d551ce3e56174f7465.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b,a+b)=(1,55)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/3/d33df617ffa04cc163ac6b698dfd1fd92740dced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(28,27)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />. This is impossible because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is not a power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.</li>\n<li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/f/e8f81f08c9d4966120c2a3cdc455a2ebd66a517f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a-b,a+b)=(5,11)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"177\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/8/578fefa5b344ce573b355a93820975c4f5f17291.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)=(8,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />. Therefore</li></ul>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/b/35bf25a4d9d51492f0b29672fcc04a04906a073d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^x=8 \\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad 3^y=3,\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" />\nso\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/4/eb4efa511163e9f8332786072d792284706cd9c6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=3 \\qquad\\text{and}\\qquad y=1.\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><b>Conclusion</b>\n</p><p>The only integer solution is\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/4/59498c900d0a9401c9f52b962eb8ec3ecbc5ed1c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{(x,y)=(3,1)}.\\]\" width=\"121\" height=\"30\" />\nTherefore, the number of solutions is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3547351abf03ab0b6cbda7b0b905b2e4f6220e1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a2194b81820e8380be586c1564c3f5d03d5c100d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <